{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_PHYSICAL_SPACE_AS_ENERGY.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience deckbuilding without energy or action points</strong>\u00a0\u2013 play your cards using physical space. There's no limit to how many cards you can play, as long as they fit! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_SIMPLE_PLACEMENT_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_BUILD_YOUR_DECK_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With <strong>three playable characters</strong> and <strong>hundreds of cards</strong> to choose from, there are countless possible decks with a variety of strategies and play styles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_CARDS_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_GEOMETRIC_STRATEGY_SCALED.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Position your cards strategically</strong> and get massive bonuses for adjacency, overlap, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_COMBO_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_MODIFY_YOUR_CARDS_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reshape your cards</strong> and inscribe them with <strong>runes of power</strong>. Spread the benefits over your entire deck, or put everything into one or two overpowered cards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_UPGRADE_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_EVERY_TURN_IS_UNIQUE_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some cards persist on your board</strong> between turns or have <strong>ongoing effects. </strong>Certain enemies will even place their own <strong>hostile cards\u00a0</strong>onto your board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_PLACEMENT_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our Discord to sign up for a playtest! </strong>We'd love to hear your feedback!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3284290?t=1747770130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747770130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/24ea52b806fd3477282826eac0ad0d8df54f9101/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747770130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/328429