re!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_COMBO_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_MODIFY_YOUR_CARDS_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reshape your cards</strong> and inscribe them with <strong>runes of power</strong>. Spread the benefits over your entire deck, or put everything into one or two overpowered cards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_UPGRADE_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_EVERY_TURN_IS_UNIQUE_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Some cards persist on your board</strong> between turns or have <strong>ongoing effects. </strong>Certain enemies will even place their own <strong>hostile cards\u00a0</strong>onto your board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/GIF_PLACEMENT_1.gif?t=1747770130\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join our Discord to sign up for a playtest! </strong>We'd love to hear your feedback!</p>","developers":["Snake Tower Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/b4e1d94